Derived work
------------

This software is a port to Apple platforms of the Android application
"CIEreader", which lives in the repository `cauer71/AndroidDev` under
`apps/cie-reader`. That application was written by Christian Auer with Stefan
Hellweger and carries the same joint copyright. The port keeps the original's
data model, its archive file format, its wording in three languages, and the
reasoning recorded in its comments; it therefore does not stand alone in
copyright terms and must not be licensed apart from the original.

